{"id":"vei_culo","lemma":"veículo","pos":"noun","rank":1718,"glosses":["vehicle; conveyance (device for carrying or transporting)","automobile (passenger vehicle)","medium (the means or channel by which an aim is achieved)"],"ipa":"/vɐˈi.ku.lu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"veículos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-ve%C3%ADculo.wav","formAudio":{"veículos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Ad%C3%A9la%C3%AFde_Calais_WMFr-ve%C3%ADculos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ambos os veículos pegaram fogo.","en":"Both vehicles caught fire.","words":[{"g":"both"},{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"fire"}]},{"text":"Aqui compramos veículos.","en":"We buy cars here.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},null]},{"text":"Inúmeros veículos foram danificados pela enchente.","en":"Several vehicles were damaged by the flood.","words":[{"g":"countless, numberless","l":"inúmero"},null,null,null,{"g":"by / for the","l":"pelar"},{"g":"flood"}]},{"text":"Hoje temos mais de três vezes o número de veículos nas estradas em 1950.","en":"Today we have more than three times as many vehicles as on the roads in 1950.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"times"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"number"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,{"g":"road","l":"estrada"},{"g":"in"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"more than"]]},{"text":"Veículos com baixo consumo de combustível podem reduzir a poluição.","en":"Fuel-efficient vehicles can reduce pollution.","words":[null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"low"},{"g":"consumption"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"combustible"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to reduce"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"pollution"}]}]}